       test evidence: unsupported  [tier: static]
         (no mapped test)
         recommended test: When the same requirement appears in two places in the task file, the derivation stage emits two obligations, one for each requirement occurrence.
           inputs:  Use a task file where the exact same requirement text appears in two distinct locations that both independently yield obligations during derivation, with both occurrences in the same derivation batch so partitioning cannot hide the defect. The two occurrences should be byte-identical in wording but have different source spans/section locations.
           detects: The derivation stage incorrectly deduplicates repeated requirements and emits only one obligation for two requirement occurrences.
           full detail: acceptance recommendation --criterion duplication-per-requirement

